OL,3,GNEWSA'Influx of rat colonies' plaguing
OL,4,Acars in cold weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car repair workshop has seen an
OL,7,F"influx" of customers bringing in
OL,8,Fvehicles that had been infested by
OL,9,Frats.
OL,11,FNew Again in Chelmsford, Essex, said it
OL,12,Fhas taken in five contaminated cars in
OL,13,Fa fortnight, handled further calls, and
OL,14,Fits website page about rats was getting
OL,15,F10 times more visits.
OL,17,FOwner Gary Wray, 60, who got in touch
OL,18,Fvia Your Voice, said the rats were
OL,19,Foften long gone by the time the cars
OL,20,Froll in, but their presence was marked
OL,21,Fby a trail of toxic excrement and
OL,22,Fnibbled wires under the hood.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
