OL,3,GNEWSA'Influx of rat colonies' plaguing
OL,4,Acars in cold weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FSam Pilgrim, from the Chelmsford branch
OL,7,Fof the East of England Pest Control,
OL,8,Fsaid rodents seek leftover food and
OL,9,Fwarmth now that the weather is turning
OL,10,Fcolder.
